return [[
This block allows you to make a click-twice variant for your custom skill.

<b><font color='rgb(221,155,155)'>Duration</font></b>
Controls how long this variant is available for.

<b><font color='rgb(221,155,155)'>Persistence</font></b>
If enabled, this variant will continue to be valid after your custom skill ends.

<b><font color='rgb(221,155,155)'>Prevent Cooldown</font></b>
If enabled, this block will prevent all cooldowns from being added to your custom skill for the duration of this block.

<b><font color='rgb(221,155,155)'>Expire Cooldown</font></b>
If enabled, the cooldown will be added to your custom skill if this variant was not used (duration passes).

<b><font color='rgb(221,155,155)'>Display Name</font></b>
If checked, this will change what your custom skill displays as in your hotbar.

<b><font color='rgb(221,155,155)'>Tool Tip</font></b>
If checked, this will change what your custom skill's tool tip is in your hotbar.

<b><font color='rgb(221,155,155)'>Flash Color</font></b>
If checked, will apply a colored flash animation to your custom skill in your hotbar.

<b><font color='rgb(221,155,155)'>Branch To</font></b>
When checked, the skill will jump to the branch specified when a target is hit.
]]